      "sources": {
        "ViridianCity_Text_WeakenMonsFirstToCatch": {
          "path": "data/kanto/maps/ViridianCity_Frlg/scripts.inc",
          "text": "Well, now, I've had my coffee, and\\nthat's what I need to get going!\\pBut I made it too strong.\\nIt gave me a headache…\\pIncidentally, are you filling your\\nPOKéDEX?\\pAt first, focus on weakening the\\nPOKéMON before trying to catch it.$",
